{"baseRefName":"docs/site-home-support-type-motion","baseRefOid":"0dfc28ba9d7106664dabf0dd60865872b632b4f8","body":"## What changed\n\nPer-page social cards, richer JSON-LD and a truthful sitemap `lastmod` (stack 5/5; base: PR 4 branch).\n\n- Every docs link unfurled with the same generic card. Each docs page now has its own (title + a one-line description from the same frontmatter the page renders), generated at build time for all pages. It is a route handler under `/og/docs`, not an `opengraph-image` file: **Next rejects that convention beneath a catch-all segment** (the docs tree is `[[...slug]]`) and the dev server panics on it.\n- `splitHeadline` moves to `lib/brand/split-headline.ts` (both card routes need it) and gains `clipLine` (ends on a word; never an ellipsis after a comma).\n- `SoftwareApplication` JSON-LD gains `image` and `author.sameAs`. The comment no longer promises a rich result (Google's software result also wants a rating or review, and there are deliberately none); a test asserts the markup never invents one.\n- Sitemap: home and `/releases` carry the latest release's date as `lastmod`; `/support` is listed. The root `keywords` meta is removed (ignored by search engines).\n\n## Verification evidence\n\nTested commit: this branch head. `rm -rf .next && bun run typecheck && bun run lint && bun run fmt:check && bun run test` in `apps/docs` → clean / 0 errors / clean / **370 pass, 0 fail**. `bun run build` on this branch → compiles; 76 static pages, `/og/docs/[[...slug]]` prerendered for every docs page, `/support` static.\n\n- Checked the rendered card for `/og/docs/users/getting-started` (title, clipped description, mascot) and that the page's `og:image`/`twitter:image` point at it.\n- `git diff` of this branch against the pre-split snapshot is empty apart from the changeset that lives in PR 1, so the five PRs together contain exactly the reviewed work.\n- Not exercised: how Slack/Discord/X render the card (needs a public URL); the Rich Results Test.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [x] Changeset: N/A (docs-only)\n- [x] `bun run guard`: N/A\n- [x] fmt / lint / test / typecheck pass locally (per package)\n- [x] `bun run build` passes (run on this branch, the top of the stack)\n- [x] Live provider or Discord smokes skipped intentionally (docs only)\n","files":[{"path":"apps/docs/app/docs/[[...slug]]/page.tsx","additions":4,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/og/docs/[[...slug]]/route.tsx","additions":63,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/sitemap.ts","additions":31,"deletions":11,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/app/w/[code]/opengraph-image.tsx","additions":2,"deletions":54,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/brand/split-headline.ts","additions":76,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/json-ld.ts","additions":14,"deletions":4,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/lib/page-metadata.ts","additions":24,"deletions":2,"changeType":"MODIFIED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/json-ld.test.ts","additions":71,"deletions":0,"changeType":"ADDED"},{"path":"apps/docs/test/share-social-card.test.ts","additions":33,"deletions":1,"changeType":"MODIFIED"}],"headRefName":"docs/seo-social-cards-jsonld","headRefOid":"6b6414dcabcac8e4c78b02fa041f1706e5f0295e","mergeable":"MERGEABLE","number":536,"reviewDecision":"","statusCheckRollup":[{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:20:40Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37089467037/job/111106505365","name":"Path filters","startedAt":"2026-10-03T02:20:34Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"CI"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-03T02:20:43Z","conclusion":"SUCCESS","detailsUrl":"https://github.com/KitsuneKode/kunai/actions/runs/37089466978/job/111106504502","name":"Version ↔ changelog guard","startedAt":"2026-10-03T02:20:33Z","status":"COMPLETED","workflowName":"Release Guard"},{"__typename":"CheckRun","completedAt":"2026-10-